+      <div class="vote-help-text"><strong>Choose the trade side you would rather receive.</strong> Do not use a trade calculator or value chart. Player values and model identities are hidden.</div>
+    </div>
+    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;">
